            "type": "text",
            "text": "A sampler teaches four stitches in one sitting. Keep the finished piece beside the canvas as a reference. This design divides an 83 by 125 hole panel into four equal horizontal sections, one stitch per section."
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "sampler"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "sampler"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " is the best first needlepoint project for two reasons: it teaches four different stitches in one sitting, and the finished piece serves as a reference you can hold next to the canvas while learning. This design divides a 83 by 125 hole panel into four equal horizontal sections, one stitch per section, with a two-hole dividing line between each."
          }
        ]
      },
